#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_res_config_settings__invoice_ocr_text_limit
msgid ""
"At most this much of a document's text is sent to the AI provider; a longer "
"text is sent as its beginning and its end (totals and payment details are "
"usually at the end), and the chatter says so. More text costs more tokens "
"and time, and must fit in the model's context. 0: the default (6000, or "
"INVOICE_OCR_TEXT_LIMIT)."
msgstr ""
"Högst så här mycket av ett dokuments text skickas till AI-tjänsten; en "
"längre text skickas som sin början och sitt slut (summor och "
"betalningsuppgifter står oftast sist), och chatten säger det. Mer text "
"kostar fler tokens och mer tid och måste rymmas i modellens kontext. 0: "
"standardvärdet (6000, eller INVOICE_OCR_TEXT_LIMIT)."

