#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Posting this bill as well would book the cost twice. Redo the reconciliation"
" of the statement line so that it matches this bill, or discard the draft if"
" the document is already booked."
msgstr ""
"Bokförs fakturan också blir kostnaden dubbel. Gör om avstämningen av "
"bankraden så att den matchar den här fakturan, eller släng utkastet om "
"underlaget redan är bokfört."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__account_move__ocr_state__pending
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__hr_expense__ocr_state__pending
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_state__pending
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "I kö"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_state
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_move__ocr_state
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_state
msgid ""
"Queued: OCR reads the document in the background, within a minute or so. "
"Reading: it is being read. Read: OCR filled it in. Failed: OCR could not "
"read it (see the error and the chatter). Empty: never queued."
msgstr ""
"I kö: OCR läser dokumentet i bakgrunden inom någon minut. Läses: det "
"läses just nu. Läst: OCR har fyllt i det. Misslyckades: OCR kunde inte "
"läsa det (se felet och chatten). Tomt: aldrig köat."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__account_move__ocr_state__done
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__hr_expense__ocr_state__done
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_state__done
msgid "Read"
msgstr "Läst"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_invoice_ocr_ai.res_config_settings_view_form_invoice_ocr
msgid ""
"Read PDFs uploaded through the Upload button or received by the journal's "
"mail alias with OCR + an LLM, in a background job within seconds."
msgstr ""
"Läs PDF:er som laddas upp med Ladda upp-knappen eller kommer till "
"journalens e-postalias med OCR + en språkmodell, i ett bakgrundsjobb inom"
" några sekunder."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__account_move__ocr_state__running
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__hr_expense__ocr_state__running
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_invoice_ocr_ai.selection__ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_state__running
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Läses"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_res_config_settings__invoice_ocr_total_deadline
msgid ""
"Reading one bill or receipt — the text and every call to the AI provider, "
"its retries included — ends within this many seconds. Never more than three "
"quarters of Odoo's request and cron time limits (limit_time_real, "
"limit_time_real_cron: 90 s with Odoo's default 120 s), so the OCR button on "
"the form returns before Odoo stops the request."
msgstr ""
"Läsningen av en faktura eller ett kvitto — texten och varje anrop till "
"AI-tjänsten, omförsöken inräknade — är klar inom så här många sekunder. "
"Aldrig mer än tre fjärdedelar av Odoos tidsgränser för anrop och cron "
"(limit_time_real, limit_time_real_cron: 90 s med Odoos standard 120 s), "
"så att OCR-knappen i formuläret svarar innan Odoo avbryter anropet."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
