msgstr "Momsregistreringsnumret %s"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_res_config_settings__invoice_ocr_account_list
msgid ""
"The account codes the AI may choose for invoice lines, one per line as "
"\"code: hint\", e.g. \"6540: IT services (consulting, managed services)\". "
"Empty: the built-in Swedish BAS list. Only accounts that exist in the bill "
"company's chart are sent; a line with another code gets the purchase "
"journal's default account."
msgstr ""
"Kontona som AI:n får välja för fakturarader, ett per rad som \"konto: "
"ledtråd\", t.ex. \"6540: IT-tjänster (konsulter, driftstjänster)\". Tomt:"
" den inbyggda svenska BAS-listan. Bara konton som finns i fakturabolagets"
" kontoplan skickas; en rad med ett annat konto får inköpsjournalens "
"standardkonto."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_invoice_ocr_ai.res_config_settings_view_form_invoice_ocr
msgid ""
"The account codes the AI may choose, one per line as 'code: hint'. Empty: "
"the built-in Swedish BAS list. Only accounts that exist in the bill "
"company's chart are offered."
msgstr ""
"Kontona som AI:n får välja, ett per rad som 'konto: ledtråd'. Tomt: den "
"inbyggda svenska BAS-listan. Bara konton som finns i fakturabolagets "
"kontoplan erbjuds."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_attachment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_move__ocr_attachment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_attachment_id
msgid ""
"The attachment OCR reads: the uploaded file, or the one chosen when OCR was "
"requested."
msgstr ""
"Bilagan som OCR läser: den uppladdade filen, eller den som valdes när OCR"
" begärdes."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_auto_debit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_move__ocr_auto_debit
msgid ""
"The bill is debited automatically from the company's account (direct debit, "
"autogiro, a bank charge) and must NOT be paid by hand or included in a "
"payment file. Set by OCR when the document says so; can be changed by hand."
msgstr ""
"Fakturan dras automatiskt från bolagets konto (autogiro, "
"direktdebitering, bankavgift) och ska INTE betalas manuellt eller tas med"
" i en betalfil. Sätts av OCR när underlaget säger det; kan ändras för "
"hand."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_res_config_settings__invoice_ocr_ollama_num_ctx
msgid ""
"The context window Ollama runs the model with (num_ctx), sent with every "
"request. Ollama's own default is small (4096 tokens on most hosts) and then "
"cuts the beginning of a long prompt — the instructions — without an error. A"
" larger value needs more RAM or VRAM. 0: the default (16384, or "
"OLLAMA_NUM_CTX)."
msgstr ""
"Kontextfönstret som Ollama kör modellen med (num_ctx), skickas med varje "
"anrop. Ollamas egen standard är liten (4096 tokens på de flesta maskiner)"
" och klipper då bort början av en lång prompt — instruktionerna — utan "
"felmeddelande. Ett större värde kräver mer RAM eller VRAM. 0: "
"standardvärdet (16384, eller OLLAMA_NUM_CTX)."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The cost may already be booked through the bank"
msgstr "Kostnaden kan redan vara bokförd via banken"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The document is in %(currency)s, but %(problem)s."
msgstr "Underlaget är i %(currency)s, men %(problem)s."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The document is in %(currency)s, but %(problem)s. The bill was left in "
"%(bill_currency)s without lines, since its amounts would be wrong by the "
"exchange rate. Activate the currency and add a rate (Accounting → "
"Configuration → Currencies), then run OCR again, or enter the lines by hand "
"in the right currency."
msgstr ""
"Underlaget är i %(currency)s, men %(problem)s. Fakturan lämnades i "
"%(bill_currency)s utan rader, eftersom beloppen annars skulle bli fel med"
" växelkursen. Aktivera valutan och lägg in en kurs (Bokföring → "
"Konfiguration → Valutor) och kör sedan OCR igen, eller lägg in raderna "
"för hand i rätt valuta."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The document is in %(document)s, the bill in %(bill)s: it already has lines,"
" so its currency was not changed."
msgstr ""
"Underlaget är i %(document)s, fakturan i %(bill)s: den har redan rader, "
"så valutan ändrades inte."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The document says the amount is debited from the company's account (\"%s\")."
" The recipient account was left empty, so the bill does not end up in a "
"payment file. Reconcile the bill with the bank statement line once the debit"
" shows, instead of paying it."
msgstr ""
"Underlaget anger att beloppet dras från bolagets konto (\"%s\"). "
"Mottagarkontot har lämnats tomt så att fakturan inte hamnar i en "
"betalfil. Stäm av fakturan mot bankraden när dragningen syns i stället "
"för att betala den."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The invoice date %(date)s is in a locked period (%(locks)s): the accounting "
"date was left as Odoo set it."
msgstr ""
"Fakturadatumet %(date)s ligger i en låst period (%(locks)s): "
"bokföringsdatumet lämnades som Odoo satte det."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The lines come from the AI's reading and do not add up to the amounts "
"printed on the document — probably a line was dropped or has the wrong VAT "
"rate. Check them against the PDF before you post the bill."
msgstr ""
"Raderna kommer från AI-tolkningen och summerar inte till beloppen som "
"står tryckta på underlaget — troligen har en rad fallit bort eller fått "
"fel momssats. Kontrollera dem mot PDF:en innan fakturan bokförs."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The name \"%(name)s\" matches several vendors (%(names)s) – none was chosen."
msgstr "Namnet \"%(name)s\" passar flera leverantörer (%(names)s) – ingen valdes."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The name \"%s\""
msgstr "Namnet \"%s\""

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The org number %s"
msgstr "Organisationsnumret %s"

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The org number %s is the company's own – not used."
msgstr "Organisationsnumret %s är bolagets eget – användes inte."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The org number %s on the bill is the company's own (the buyer's) – not used "
"as the vendor's."
msgstr ""
"Organisationsnumret %s på fakturan är bolagets eget (köparens) – användes"
" inte som leverantörens."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_auto_debit_phrase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_move__ocr_auto_debit_phrase
msgid ""
"The phrase in the document that made OCR set 'Debited automatically'. Empty "
"when the flag was set or changed by hand – then running OCR again leaves it "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"Frasen i underlaget som fick OCR att sätta 'Dras automatiskt'. Tom när "
"flaggan satts eller ändrats för hand – då rör en ny OCR-körning den inte."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "The recipient account %s belongs to the company itself – removed."
msgstr "Mottagarkontot %s tillhör det egna bolaget – togs bort."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The supplier is abroad and charged foreign VAT (%(vat)s). Foreign VAT is not"
" deductible in Sweden: it is booked as part of the cost, without Swedish VAT"
" and without reverse charge. If the purchase should have been invoiced "
"without VAT (reverse charge), ask the supplier for a corrected invoice."
msgstr ""
"Leverantören finns utomlands och har debiterat utländsk moms (%(vat)s). "
"Utländsk moms är inte avdragsgill i Sverige: den bokförs som en del av "
"kostnaden, utan svensk moms och utan omvänd skattskyldighet. Borde köpet "
"ha fakturerats utan moms (omvänd skattskyldighet), be leverantören om en "
"rättad faktura."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The supplier is abroad but charged Swedish VAT (%(number)s): booked as "
"Swedish input VAT, without reverse charge."
msgstr ""
"Leverantören finns utomlands men har debiterat svensk moms (%(number)s): "
"bokförs som svensk ingående moms, utan omvänd skattskyldighet."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_invoice_ocr_ai.res_config_settings_view_form_invoice_ocr
msgid ""
"The text of the document (never the file) is sent to this provider. staik "
"keeps data in Sweden; Venice and OpenAI are in the USA; Ollama and a custom "
"endpoint can be on your own hardware."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentets text (aldrig filen) skickas till den här tjänsten. staik "
"behåller data i Sverige; Venice och OpenAI finns i USA; Ollama och en "
"egen tjänst kan köras på egen hårdvara."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_bank_statement_line__ocr_requested_by
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_account_move__ocr_requested_by
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_invoice_ocr_ai.field_ocr_queue_mixin__ocr_requested_by
msgid ""
"The user who queued the document for OCR. The background job reads it as "
"this user: with their access rights (a vendor is only created by a user who "
"may create contacts), in their language, and their name is on the notes. A "
"document that came in by e-mail is read as its sender when the sender is a "
"user; otherwise this is empty and the job reads it as OdooBot."
msgstr ""
"Användaren som köade dokumentet för OCR. Bakgrundsjobbet läser det som "
"den användaren: med användarens behörigheter (en leverantör skapas bara "
"av en användare som får skapa kontakter), på användarens språk och med "
"användarens namn på anteckningarna. Ett inmailat dokument läses som "
"avsändaren när avsändaren är en användare; annars är fältet tomt och "
"jobbet läser det som OdooBot."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_ocr_ai/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The vendor is the company itself (%s) and no other vendor could be found – "
"choose the vendor by hand."
msgstr ""
"Leverantören är det egna bolaget (%s) och ingen annan leverantör kunde "
"hittas – välj leverantör för hand."

#. module: account_invoice_ocr_ai
